### FastPDF local API requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:2626
@password = K7mN9pQwXyZ2vB4jF6sH8tL1cD3eR5uG

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Authenticate
# @name authenticate
POST {{baseUrl}}/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Render PDF
@token = {{authenticate.response.body.$.token}}

POST {{baseUrl}}/pdf-render
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/pdf

{
  "html": "<html><body><h1>Hello from FastPDF</h1><p>This PDF was generated locally.</p></body></html>",
  "filename": "local-test"
}
